              stream offset appropriately.

              If _*_w_r_i_t_e is a null pointer, then output to the stream  is  dis‐
              carded.

       _c_o_o_k_i_e___s_e_e_k___f_u_n_c_t_i_o_n___t _*_s_e_e_k
