                  int seek(void *cookie, off_t *offset, int whence);

              The _*_o_f_f_s_e_t argument specifies the new file offset depending  on
              which of the following three values is supplied in _w_h_e_n_c_e:

              SSEEEEKK__SSEETT
                     The  stream  offset  should be set _*_o_f_f_s_e_t bytes from the
                     start of the stream.

              SSEEEEKK__CCUURR
